# __CRATE__-admin

Leptos operator package for __SLUG__ records. The workspace displays actual
tenant records through the shared data grid with server pagination and
localized titles. The editor creates drafts, opens and saves an explicit
translation, and controls publication.

With `--ui admin` the manifest registers this package at `/modules/__ROUTE__`.
With `--ui dual`, the package remains a preview while the storefront is in
development.

The `settings` route lists the available settings sections. The
`settings/records` section edits the tenant's default page size and public
discovery policy for published records.
Reads use the exact module settings snapshot. Saves use the platform
`updateModuleSettings` GraphQL mutation with the snapshot revision and
an idempotency key. This is the same mutation used by module management.

## Data contract

SSR and hydrate use same-origin server functions with the platform's trusted
tenant, session and effective locale. CSR reads and mutates through the
published [GraphQL documents](../contracts/graphql/) and the host's auth state.
Both use the same owner authorization, module admission, tenant page-size
setting, edit revision and durable publication path. Transport errors never
retry through another protocol.

The editor shows the requested and effective languages and the available
translations. A fallback title is displayed separately from the empty field
for a missing translation. A conflict or an unconfirmed write preserves the
operator's input and requires a fresh owner read before another edit.

## Structure

- src/core/mod.rs owns grid presentation and page selection.
- src/core/editor.rs owns translation selection, checked command construction
  and application of owner responses.
- src/core/settings.rs validates the page size and builds an edit of the
  current revisioned settings document.
- src/model.rs owns framework-neutral client DTOs.
- src/transport/ owns native and GraphQL reads and commands.
- src/ui/leptos/ renders the record workspace.
- locales/en.ftl and locales/ru.ftl contain operator copy.

## Verification

- cargo test -p __CRATE__-admin --features ssr --lib
- cargo check -p __CRATE__-admin --features csr --target wasm32-unknown-unknown
- cargo check -p __CRATE__-admin --features hydrate --target wasm32-unknown-unknown
